  "id": "BIT-mongodb-2026-13075",
  "summary": "$rankFusion and $scoreFusion Unbounded Memory Allocation During Error Suggestion Generation",
  "details": "An authenticated user can cause the mongod process to be terminated by the operating system under memory pressure via the $rankFusion and $scoreFusion aggregation stages. The issue originates in the server's error-handling path and requires the ability to run aggregation queries.",
